session*.md
worklog*.md
NOTES*.md
notes*.md
PR*.md
commit_msg*.txt
/scratch*.md
/SCRATCH*.md
/temp*.md
/TEMP*.md
/test*.md
/TEST*.md
/audit*.md
/AUDIT*.md
/report*.md
/REPORT*.md
*.prep
*.prep.*
prep/
preps/
*.ideas
*.ideas.*
ideas/
*.plan
*.plan.*
plans/
*.draft
*.draft.*
drafts/
audit/
!/docs/audit/
!/docs/audit/**
audits/
reports/
todos/
